# Student Achievements and Participation Data Storage

This project is a lightweight web application for storing and managing student achievement records. It supports:

- add, update, and delete records
- search and filter by category
- academic, technical, sports, cultural, and extracurricular categories
- certificate/document upload using browser file input
- basic admin login for authorized users
- local browser storage for persistence

## Run locally

From this project folder, run:

```bash
python -m http.server 8000
```

Then open:

```text
http://localhost:8000
```

## Default login

- Email: admin@college.edu
- Password: admin123

## Project files

- `index.html` – application layout
- `styles.css` – interface design
- `script.js` – records logic and local storage
